We are pleased to inform you that your interview for the position of {{Jobtitle}} at Techmatrix Consultancy has been successfully scheduled.

📅 Interview Details:

Candidate Name: {!candidateRecord.First_Name__c} {!candidateRecord.Last_Name__c}

Interview Type: {!Interview_Type}

Date &amp; Time: {!Interview_Date_and_time}

Interviewer Name:{!Interviewer_Name_lookup.recordName} 

Meeting Link:{!Meeting_Link.value}

If you have any questions or require rescheduling, please feel free to contact us in advance.

We look forward to speaking with you and learning more about your background and skills.

Best regards,
Techmatrix Consultancy</stringValue>
